    basic: "Remember that the Ace is the most valuable card (1 point) but it is vulnerable to the 2 and 3. Don't play an Ace unless you know the 2 and 3 are gone or your partner sits behind you to protect it.",
    intermediate: "The 'Busso': Use the Knock signal only when you command the suit (e.g., you hold 3-2-K). Your partner is obligated (strategically) to return that suit to you.",
